; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - trailing result M10 + Step trailing, setup 2 of 3: sell, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter D1 EMA 20, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: every 1.5R of profit lifts the stop by 1.5R, one step behind (breakeven at +1.5R). Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 4, TrailParam 0).
