; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 25 trades, PF 0.50, net -8.0R; the 3 setups of this combination together 161 trades, PF 1.36 (stressed 1.26).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 45 trades, PF 1.36; 2023: this setup 43 trades, PF 0.85. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.12 (310 trades); 2023 PF 0.79 (291 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT M1 in broker server time, assumed spread 10 USD. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
